The tests cover each acceptance criterion:

\begin{itemize}
\item \textbf{AC \#1}: Required torrent path parsing
\item \textbf{AC \#2}: Output directory option with default
\item \textbf{AC \#3}: Port option with default
\item \textbf{AC \#4}: Verbose flag
\item \textbf{AC \#5}: Help output generation
